---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout basePath="" title="Career & Wealth | Waitlist">
  <!-- PAGE HEADER -->
  <section class="pt-32 pb-16 px-4 bg-brand-navy text-center border-b border-brand-navy-light">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-2 rounded-full bg-white/10 border border-white/20 text-brand-saffron text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase mb-6">
        <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-brand-saffron animate-pulse"></span>
        In Development
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold text-white mb-6 tracking-tight">The Invisible Ceiling.</h1>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-slate-300 leading-relaxed font-medium max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Why your effort isn't translating into financial reality, and why working harder won't fix it.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- THE PROBLEM -->
  <section class="py-24 px-4 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-6">The Anatomy of Financial Sabotage</h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-brand-text leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto">
          Financial growth is rarely stopped by a lack of opportunity. It is stopped by a behavioral pattern. If you subconsciously believe that wealth requires suffering, or if your pattern forces you to burn money the second you get it, no amount of business strategy will save you. You will always find a way to return to your baseline.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-16">
        <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-brand-border p-8 rounded-2xl">
          <div class="text-3xl mb-4">📉</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-brand-navy text-xl mb-3">The "Almost There" Pattern</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-text text-sm leading-relaxed">
            You work incredibly hard. You build the foundation. You get right to the edge of the breakthrough—and then you lose interest. You suddenly pivot to a "new idea." You leave the harvest behind right before the crops are ready. Your pattern is addicted to the struggle of starting, and terrified of the pressure of succeeding.
          </p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="bg-slate-50 border border-brand-border p-8 rounded-2xl">
          <div class="text-3xl mb-4">💸</div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-brand-navy text-xl mb-3">The Leak</h3>
          <p class="text-brand-text text-sm leading-relaxed">
            You know how to make money. The problem is, you don't know how to keep it. Every time your bank account hits a certain number, an "emergency" happens, or you make a highly impulsive purchase you justify as an "investment." Your behavioral baseline is programmed for financial stress, so it artificially creates it.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-brand-light-bg border border-brand-saffron/30 p-10 rounded-3xl text-center">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-4">The Wealth Systems Upgrade</h2>
        <p class="text-brand-text mb-8 max-w-xl mx-auto">
          We are building a diagnostic tool specifically designed to map your financial and career sabotage loops. It will identify exactly where you leak energy, where you block opportunities, and give you the mechanical steps to raise your baseline.
        </p>
        
        <div class="max-w-md mx-auto bg-white p-6 rounded-xl border border-brand-border shadow-sm">
          <h3 class="font-bold text-brand-navy mb-2">Join the Waitlist</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-brand-text-muted mb-4">Be the first to access the Career & Wealth diagnosis tool.</p>
          <form class="flex flex-col gap-3" onsubmit="event.preventDefault(); alert('You have been added to the waitlist!');">
            <input type="email" placeholder="Enter your email address" class="w-full p-3 border border-brand-border rounded-lg outline-none focus:border-brand-saffron" required>
            <button type="submit" class="w-full py-3 bg-brand-navy text-white rounded-lg font-bold hover:bg-brand-saffron transition-colors">Notify Me</button>
          </form>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
